  "status": "Application Under Consideration",
  "description": "Planning permission and Listed Building Consent are sought to formally divide this 5-bedroom late Georgian / early Victorian Grade II listed residential property into two separate properties comprising a 4-bedroom ‘main house’, which is referred to in this application as no. 15, and an adjoining 1-bedroom property, referred to as no. 15A. The proposed division is consistent with, and seeks to follow, the approach adopted along the majority of this terrace to split the historically serviced large family homes (with adjoining servants’ quarters) into two separate residential properties. In addition, building works are proposed to conserve and repair the interior and external envelope of the property, and to add a stair, bathroom and bedroom to 15A. Please see supporting documents for full and further details. ",
